important form of outreach to the broader Cheyenne community，which
will draw increased visitation to our core product indowntown.
·Downtown Development-This project is consistent with, supports, and furthers
the initiatives currently being undertaken by the Downtown Development
Authority(DDA).This includes beautification of downtown, positioning downtown
Cheyenne asa destination, and enhancing the taxbase within theDDA district.
Timetable
The scheduled timeframe for the proposed project will be executed in the following
manner:
·Exterior Building Refurbishment(4Q2015-2Q2016)-Planning is completed
and bids have been received for renovation of the building exterior.Renovation
of the exterior building facade will commence no later than year-end2015.This
project phase will include removal of exterior metal awnings&paint, and
resurfacing damaged sections of the original glazed tile walls under the awnings
andpainted areas(AttachmentD).Theproject will be completed during spring
building.Post renovation thebuilding willook as represented in Attachment E.
Interior Planning Phase(4Q2015-3Q2016)-Interior building design and
operational planning will commence during the4Quarterof2015andis
scheduled to be completed early3Q2016.
Construction Phase(3Q2016-2Q2017)-Build-outof the building interior is
scheduled for completion at theendof2Q2017.Aconceptual lookof thefuture
floorplan isrendered in Attachment F.
Launch Phase(3Q2017)-After completion of the construction phase
operational, training & logistic planning will commence.Remaining licensing,
certificates of operation, and other regulatory approval willbe completed with a
scheduled launch no later than3Q2017.
