Alachmen G- Leuse
COMMERCIAL LEASE
THIS LEASE made and entered into this 15th day of September,2015 at
Cheyenne, Wyoming, by and between Otis Investments, LLC, a Wyoming limited
liability company, hereinafter called "Lessor", and Central Enterprises Inc., a Wyoming
corporation, hereinafter collectively called"Lessee".
WITNESSETH:
WHEREAS, Lessor owns the real property andbuilding located at1701Carey
Avenue, Cheyenne, WY 82001 which may hereinafter be called the“Property.”
referred to as the“Premises".
WHEREAS, Lessor desires to lease the Premises known as 1701, on the terms
and conditions here in after set forth.
NOW, THEREFORE, it is mutually agreed between the parties hereto as
follows:
DEMISE AND TERM.Lessor hereby leases to Lessee, and Lessee
hereby rents from Lessor, 1701 (the Premises) for a term of 5 year(s) commencing on
October 1, 2015. The Premises shall consist of 9000 sq.ft.located on the first floor and
basement of the building at 1701 Carey, Cheyenne, WY.Lessee shall have the right to
delay the commencement date of this Lease up to 90 days based upon its acquisition of a
City of Cheyenne retail liquor license.Lessor shall have the right to terminate this lease
should Lesseefail to obtain a City of Cheyenne retail liquor license by January 31, 2016.
2.LIQUOR SERVICE.
Lessor acknowledges that alcoholic
beverages will be dispensed and consumed on the Premises during the term of the Lease
and Lessor does not object thereto.
3.RENT AND SECURITY DEPOSIT.
Lessee shall pay as rent for
the Premises, the total sum of
payable in monthly installments of$
each installment being paid in advance on the first day of each and every month during
the term hereof beginning with themonth of October.Anypayment received more than
10 days after the due date shall have added thereto a late payment penalty equal to10%
of the payment.At the time of execution of the lease the Lessee shall also pay a damage
and security deposit in an amount equal to one month's rent. Such deposit shall be
returned within30days of the expiration of the lease providedi) all payments are current;
i) the premises are appropriately and thoroughly cleaned (which shall include all carpets
being professionally cleaned); and i) there is no un-repaired damage to the premises
normal wear and tear excepted.
