thereof, shall be condemned or taken by public authority, Lessee shall have the election
to terminate this Lease.In the event of a partial condemnation or taking, and if Lessee
continues its use and occupancy of the portion not so condemned or taken, the fixed rent
payable hereunder shall be reduced by the proportion that the value of the condemned
